m"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-breitenfeld-1631"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Breitenfeld (1631)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1631</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Breitenfeld was fought in 1631 near Leipzig during the Thirty Years' War.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-lutzen-1632"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Lützen (1632)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1632</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Lützen was fought in 1632 in Saxony during the Thirty Years' War between the Swedish army and imperial forces under Wallenstein.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-nordlingen-1634"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-nordlingen-1634.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Nördlingen (1634)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1634</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Nördlingen, fought on 6 September 1634 in Swabia, was a crushing victory of the imperial and Spanish armies under the future Emperor Ferdinand III and the…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-downs"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-the-downs.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of the Downs</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1639</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of the Downs was a naval battle fought on 21 October 1639 off the coast of Kent, during the Eighty Years' War.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-newburn"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-newburn.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Newburn</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 1640</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Newburn was fought on 28 August 1640 at a ford over the River Tyne west of Newcastle, where the Covenant